{"expert_response": "```json
{
  "analysis_summary": "This structure demonstrates awareness of EDIFACT's hierarchical nature (Interchange/Message/Segment) and includes key business entities (Organization, LineItem, Price). However, it achieves only ~25-30% coverage of a complete D96A EANCOM INVOIC message. Critical segments for dates, quantities, measurements, tax breakdowns, payment terms, and allowances/charges are entirely absent. The model conflates technical structure (delimiters, composite elements) with business semantics.",

  "completeness_score": 0.28,

  "extensions_required": [
    {
      "type": "class",
      "name": "DTMSegment (Date/Time/Period)",
      "priority": "high",
      "rationale": "MANDATORY in D96A EANCOM. Must support qualifiers 137 (Document Date - MANDATORY), 35 (Delivery Date), 263 (Invoice Period Start), 264 (Invoice Period End). Without DTM, the invoice has no temporal context and cannot be processed."
    },
